  "zh": "# 歼-35A首秀珠海、OpenAI反诉苹果、国常会提国家队、酒店拒住40岁等成焦点\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI 反诉 苹果**：OpenAI 罕见反诉巨头指控窃密，揭示大模型商业版图的核心博弈与知识产权红线。\n- **AI 融脸 维权 难**：模特脸被盗用做短剧恶役却难获赔，暴露生成式 AI 侵权取证与平台责任的法律真空。\n- **美国 起诉 SpaceX**：多州检察长状告马斯克旗下 X 与 Grok 生成儿童性虐待材料，直指生成式 AI 安全护栏失效。\n## 中国聚焦\n- **歼-35A 珠海 首秀**：隐身战机首次公开静展，标志着中国海基航空战力跨代升级与防区反介入能力实质增强。\n- **国常会 提 国家队**：高层会议首提「国家队」「平准基金」，释放托底股市与稳预期的强烈政策信号。\n- **电动 车 15 企 点名**：雅迪爱玛等头部企业因不合格产品被通报，新国标落地倒逼行业从卷价格转向卷质量。\n## 社会民生\n- **酒店 拒住 40 岁**：酒店明令拒收 40 岁以上客人引发年龄歧视讨论，经营自主权与平等权边界待司法界定。\n- **后会友期 告密门**：真人秀「告密机制」引爆厉娜许飞友情崩塌，折射流量综艺对真实关系的消费与伦理失守。\n- **卖房 次日 拆迁**：房主 178 万签约次日得知拆迁反悔，合同效力与诚信原则在巨额利益面前接受极限压测。",
  "en": "# J-35A debuts at Zhuhai, OpenAI sues Apple, State Council signals market support, hotel age ban sparks debate\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI Sues Apple**：OpenAI rarely countersues a giant alleging trade theft, exposing core IP battles in the LLM commercial landscape.\n- **AI Face-swap Rights**：Model's face stolen for AI villain role with little legal recourse, highlighting the liability vacuum in generative AI deepfakes.\n- **US States Sue SpaceX**： AGs sue Musk's X and Grok over CSAM generation, directly challenging generative AI safety guardrails.\n## China Focus\n- **J-35A Zhuhai Debut**： Stealth fighter's first public static display marks a generational leap in China's naval air power and A2/AD capability.\n- **State Council Names National Team**： Top meeting cites \"national team\" and \"stabilization fund\" for first time, signaling strong intent to prop up markets.\n- **15 EV Makers Named**： Yadea, Aima and others cited for substandard products; new standards force shift from price war to quality race.\n## Social & Livelihood\n- **Hotel Bans Over 40s**： Hotel refusing guests over 40 sparks age discrimination debate, testing boundaries of business autonomy vs equal rights.\n- **See You Again Snitch Gate**： Reality show 'snitch mechanism' destroys friendship between Li Na and Xu Fei, exposing ethics void in traffic-chasing variety shows.\n- **House Sold Day Before Demolition**： Owner signs 1.78M deal then learns of demolition next day; contract validity vs good faith tested by windfall."
